---
import { siteForms } from '../config/site';
const { review } = siteForms();
---
<section class="front-door" id="progress"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><h2>From conversation to useful work.</h2><p>Free resources and open learning, built one practical step at a time. We will share what is ready, what is planned and what still needs work.</p></div>
  <div class="resource-grid">
    <article class="resource-card"><h3>Financial literacy</h3><p>A simple bill calendar to see what is due and when. Work through an example and keep your own numbers private.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resources/month-ahead/">Read the first resource</a></article>
    <article class="resource-card"><h3>Free calls &amp; webinars</h3><p>No public session is scheduled yet. When a topic, presenter and time are confirmed, details will appear on our events page.</p><a class="text-link" href="/events/">See public event status</a></article>
  </div>
  <div class="progress-record"><h3>Progress record</h3><p><time datetime="2026-10-30">October 30, 2026</time> · {review ? 'Local preview for review' : 'First resource available'}</p><p>{review ? 'The first financial literacy resource is prepared for publication.' : 'Our first financial literacy guide and blank bill-calendar worksheet are available free.'} Veteran initiatives and ending poverty resources are in preparation. No program outcomes have been measured.</p><p>Next: try the resource, share a question through our contact page, and help us choose a useful first public session.</p></div>
</div></section>
